                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The jabberwock Flies or makes a wing Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The jabberwock's wings whiffle, creating severe winds within a @Template[emanation|distance:30]. These winds move outward from the jabberwock, and they persist until the start of the jabberwock's next turn. During this time, flight of any kind in the emanation requires a successful [[/act maneuver-in-flight dc=43]]{Acrobatics} check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Maneuver in Flight], and creatures flying toward the jabberwock are moving through greater difficult terrain. Creatures on the ground in the emanation must succeed at a @Check[athletics|dc:43|name:Approach Jabberwock] check to approach the jabberwock.</p>"
